  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 문체부 훈민정음체; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 문체부 훈민정음체; mso-hansi-font-family: 문체부 훈민정음체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&#9702; </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 문체부 훈민정음체; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 문체부 훈민정음체;\">바이러스 신문 만들기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -40.9pt; margin-left: 40.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">주제</span><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">바이러스가 인간에게 어떻게 영향을 미치는지 탐구하여 신문으로 제작하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">- 규격</span><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">: 4</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">절지 </span><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">1</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">매로 제한</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">- 자료의 출처를 반드시 밝힐 것</span><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">그대로 옮겨 적는 게 아니라 나만의 것으로 기사화하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo3;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">- 평가기준 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">① </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">과학적으로 유용한 정보인가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">          </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ② </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">창의적으로 구성했는가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">          </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ③ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">전달력이 높은가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">2주밖에 안되는 짧은 방학이지만, 기다려지네요 ㅎㅎ</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -55.9pt; margin-left: 55.9pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 맑은 고딕 !important; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">즐거운 하루 되세요^^</span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"13133\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{ \"documentPr\": { \"di\": \"\", \"dp\": { \"dn\": \"test.hwp\", \"ta\": 1, \"d1\": 5, \"d2\": 1, \"dv\": 0, \"dr\": 1, \"do\": 1, \"vj\": \"1.1\", \"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\", \"av\": \"10, 0, 0, 9139\", \"ao\": \"WIN\", \"ab\": \"32\", \"ar\": \"LE\", \"as\": \"Windows_8\" }, \"dis\": false, \"ds\": { \"ti\": \"바이러스 신문 만들기\", \"la\": \"ko\", \"cr\": \"충청북도교육청\", \"su\": \"\", \"de\": \"\", \"cd\": \"2020-07-13T09:46:10.671Z\", \"md\": \"2020-07-13T09:46:11.712Z\", \"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\", \"ke\": \"\" } }, \"dh\": { \"do\": { \"pa\": 1, \"fo\": 1, \"en\": 1, \"pi\": 1, \"tb\": 1, \"eq\": 1 }, \"fo\": [ ], \"cd\": { \"tp\": 0, \"lc\": { \"af